  message: "Fixed in PR #4263 (merged origin/dev e354900c5a). Root cause confirmed and resolved STRUCTURALLY across the whole family: 9 doc/markup/template analyzers (rst/scss/vue/svelte/puppet/robot/astro/twig/pony) reused their raw composite Symbol.id as stable_id; all now route through the shared make_doc_stable_id factory. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE: live rst repro went 3 non-canonical -> 0 (id stays raw 'rst:index.rst:section:section_1', stable_id now 'sha256:066b2a4572c9251f'); full suite 3583 passed at 100% coverage on changed files; per-analyzer canonical-stable_id assertion tests added; pre-existing id==stable_id tests updated to assert the now-correct divergence. Scope expansion: the original cohort surfaced only rst/vue/scss (pretix 1223 + chatwoot 12664 nonconforming); the root-cause grep found exactly these 9 producers (markdown/gitignore were already canonical)."  # 3df4
